# English-only
All the documentation and specification material this project relies on (Liberty, Verilog, SDC, SPEF, SDF,
Tcl, STA literature) is in English, so the project uses English exclusively.
## Output
- Write all responses, plans, documents, rules, skills, hooks, commit messages, code, identifiers,
  comments, and log or error messages in English.
## Input
- Reference material added to the repository (specifications, papers, examples) must be in English.
- Prompts and instructions should be written in English. If a prompt arrives in another language,
  respond in English and briefly ask for the request to be restated in English when the meaning is uncertain.